I go to my bedroom.
I get ready for the office.
I put on a blue shirt and black trousers.
I take my office bag.
I am packing my things.
I put my laptop in the bag.
Then I go to the kitchen.
My lunchbox is on the table.
I take the lunchbox.
I am putting it in the bag.
I also take a water bottle.
Now I check everything.
My phone, wallet, and house keys are in the bag.
I look in the mirror.
I am looking good.
I am ready for work.
I put on my shoes.
I open the house door.
I am going to the bus stop.
